OL,3,GNEWSA#100 heating oil payments to start
OL,4,Ain September
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Stormont scheme which will give
OL,7,Feligible households a #100 voucher
OL,8,Ftowards home heating oil costs will
OL,9,Fopen for applications next month.
OL,11,FAround 340,000 lower-income households
OL,12,Fare expected to qualify for the payment
OL,13,Fwhich was first announced in March.
OL,15,FApplications will made via the NIdirect
OL,16,Fgovernment website from Wednesday 9
OL,17,FSeptember.
OL,19,FMeanwhile, a separate scheme will give
OL,20,Fall households around #50 off their
OL,21,Felectricity bills in October.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
